+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+A client asks for its own conversation metadata with this frame:
+
+```json
+{"type": "list_conversations", "limit": 50, "before": {"updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z", "sessionId": "last"}}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type    | Required | Description                                                     |
+| -------- | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `type`   | string  | Yes      | `"list_conversations"`                                          |
+| `limit`  | integer | No       | Page size, from 1 through 200                                   |
+| `before` | object  | No       | Composite cursor with string `updatedAt` and string `sessionId` |
+
+- Validation accepts the frame independently of configuration, forwards only its defined fields, accepts a limit of 1–200 and a complete cursor whose string time `Date.parse` accepts, and refuses malformed fields with an error naming the field ([validated by: validates history limits and composite cursors independently of deployment options](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L88)).
+- History is separately opted into through `transport.history.enabled`, default off; absent or disabled history and a store without `listFor` answer exactly one `UNSUPPORTED` error and no list, leaving the socket open ([validated by: answers UNSUPPORTED with no list when history is absent, disabled, or the store cannot list](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L158)).
+- A history request is answered outside the per-session turn lock, before a pending turn's `stream_end` ([validated by: answers a history request before the active turn ends without acquiring its lock](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L184)).
+- A store failure produces one `SERVER_ERROR` without store detail, leaves the socket usable, and is logged with the session id without user content ([validated by: sanitizes a real store failure, logs the session id, and keeps the socket usable](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L217)).
 
